{
 "meta": {
  "source": "5623 player-matches x 3 duels (20 s), real builds both sides",
  "formula": "(real item dmg / real gun dmg) / (sim item dmg / sim gun dmg), item holders only, gun damage while the item was owned",
  "sample": "phantom_sample.jsonl.gz",
  "use": "deadsim realistic mode scales an item's own damage by min(1, landing)",
  "length": "fights with Mechanics.fight_length use landing (fit with every hit of a 20 s duel in full) x length_corr (the sim's source/gun in full / the same expected over real fight lengths, scripts/fight_length/length_factors.py, phantom_sample.jsonl.gz, 3 rounds)",
  "heroes": "per-hero factors from the damage audit's hero x item rows (h_all.jsonl.gz; Split Shot rows post_hotfix_2026-11-07_sample.jsonl.gz, >= 20 holders): current factor x (real/sim)^(n/(n+20)), capped 0.25-1 (1 / length_corr for an item with a pooled length_corr below 1, accuracy.HERO_LENGTH_LIFT); replace the pooled factor for that hero (scripts/item_landing_heroes.py)",
  "entry_hp_kept": "length_corr scaled so held first casts and Mechanics.entry_hp (as configured in the run) keep the expected levels of a target run at full health with the previous holds (length_factors.py --entry --target-holds)",
  "cast_timing_kept": "length_corr scaled so held first casts (Mechanics.cast_timing) keep the expected levels of cast-on-sight duels; rerun from the factors before"
